      "mergedPostDetails": "Description\n\nMost of the time i am not able to load videos. I either receive \"video failed loading / video error \" or rate limited. \u000bI tried several fixes such as updating yt-dlp.exe, reinstalling VRChat, resetting my internet ( dynamic IP ), list goes on. Other users are having the same issue so i'm assuming it's on VRC's end.\u000bSometimes videos DO load but it's once every many, many tries.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nYou can easily go to any world that has a video player and try to load a video. \u000bI'm currently sitting in audio orbs and all the pre-loaded youtube links are failing to load.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: Other\n\n- Frequency: Often\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.1-1886-a268441585-Release\n\nunityVersion: 2022.3.22f2-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-08-19_17-23-58.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_f706008b-2831-488f-a69d-98ae45e41a39/1/file)",
